WEBVTT

00:09:58.787 --> 00:10:01.579
So don't tell us
what is or isn't possible,

00:10:01.579 --> 00:10:04.954
don’t tell us it’s too hard
or too expensive or too aggressive.

00:10:05.662 --> 00:10:08.371
It's been our job
since the start of this pandemic --

00:10:08.412 --> 00:10:10.912
no, it's been our job since always

00:10:10.954 --> 00:10:13.412
to make what seems impossible
really happen.

00:10:14.037 --> 00:10:15.704
And when the stakes are this high,

00:10:15.746 --> 00:10:17.287
and the evidence is this clear,

00:10:18.162 --> 00:10:19.412
it's our only option.